# The end of Act I (Milestone 20d). Plays right after the fourth hero is
# rescued, in whichever dungeon that happens. {a1}-{a3} are the three who
# joined along the way (party order); the starting hero is "player". Then the
# Act I / Act II card, and the party is back outside on the overworld.

spawn {a1} {a1} at ~-1,-1 facing down
spawn {a2} {a2} at ~0,-1 facing down
spawn {a3} {a3} at ~1,-1 facing down
face player up
wait 0.5
emote {a2} note
say Vael: Four of us. I'd started to believe the Cathedral's light was the last one left.
say Ryn: Then we train together. Whatever Vorath sends next, it meets all four of us at once.
say Lyra: Fire, frost, storm and stone - and a knight, a monk and a thief besides. Let the Unraveling try to swallow that.
say Silas: So what now? Nobody locks up four people just to leave the rest of the world alone.
spawn frank frank at ~0,2 facing up
move frank to ~0,1
emote frank note
say Frank: Now that is a sight. All four of you, still shining clean. Couldn't sit still in Verdance - had to see it for myself.
say Frank: And you're right to ask. The forest was only where Vorath hid you. The real harm is out beyond it.
say Frank: Three kingdoms - the Tundra, the Desert, the Coast - each one held by souls the Unraveling already turned. Break their hold, and the land starts to breathe again.
emote player !
say Frank: Rest first. Stock up. Then we set out together. Somebody has to keep you in potions.
fade out 1.5
despawn {a1}
despawn {a2}
despawn {a3}
despawn frank
movie start
music intro
image stars res://assets/movie/intro_title.png at 0,0
fade in 1
title Act I - The Gathering
wait 3
title clear
caption Four pure souls stand together at last.
wait 3
caption Beyond the Forest Heartlands, three kingdoms wait in Vorath's grip.
wait 3.5
caption clear
title Act II - The Purge
wait 2
caption Coming in a later update.
wait 3.5
caption clear
title clear
music stop 1.5
fade out 1.5
remove stars
movie end
